  "translation": "Nake Akici aramũithia Dawidi, akĩmũũra atĩrĩ: Nĩ ndĩ wa hinya Yahwe arĩ mũgũrũ, nĩwe ũrĩa wĩ mũthingu, na kwenda kwaku kũhĩtũkĩra ng'ania-inĩ yaku hamwe na iwe hĩndĩ ya mũthingo, nĩndĩtheretie wega guothe kuuma mũthenya wa kwiya nakwa gĩkũro kĩrĩa kĩu, ndĩngĩhota kũona kĩo gĩkũrongorerwo-inĩ. No mĩrĩtha-inĩ ya andũ-a-taihu, ndĩwe ũrĩa mwendekere o na ũmwe.",
